Fuel Leak
Drive Damaged

Effect

The spacecraft loses 1D x 10% of its fuel capacity.
Roll 1D. On 1–3, the manoeuvre drive is hit; reduce Thrust by -1 and all Pilot
checks suffer DM-1. On 4–6, the jump drive is hit and disabled – it may not be used
until repaired.
One random turret (or weapon, if no turrets are present) is damaged DM-1 on all
attack rolls made with it.
The spacecraft’s Power is reduced by 25% and it takes 1D extra damage, ignoring
armour. All crew suffer 2D x 10 rads per week.

